---
layout: base.njk
lastModified: 2026-09-29
title: SkiBuds App News & Launch Updates
seoTitle: Ski & Snowboard App News and Launch Updates
description: Follow the SkiBuds rebuild for iOS and Android, with launch updates and previews of ski buddy discovery, snow forecasts, maps, and GPS tracking.
pageType: CollectionPage
---

  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Updates</p>
    <h1>SkiBuds app news<br>and launch updates</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Launch updates, feature spotlights, and behind-the-scenes from the team rebuilding SkiBuds.
    </p>
    <p>Planning your next day on snow? Read our <a href="/guides/">ski and snowboard guides</a> for finding a crew, sharing the drive, and understanding the forecast.</p>

    <div class="blog-list">
      {% for post in collections.blog %}
        <article class="blog-card">
          <header>
            <p class="blog-card__meta">
              <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
              {% if post.data.tags %}
                {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
                  <span class="blog-card__tag">{{ tag }}</span>
                {% endfor %}
              {% endif %}
            </p>
            <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
            {% if post.data.description %}
              <p class="blog-card__description">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </header>
          <footer>
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn btn--quiet" aria-label="Read more: {{ post.data.title }}">Read more →</a>
          </footer>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if collections.blog.length === 0 %}
      <p class="lede" style="text-align: center; padding: 3rem;">
        No updates yet. Check back soon!
      </p>
    {% endif %}

    <hr style="margin: 3rem 0;">
    <p style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/faq/" class="btn btn--quiet">FAQ</a>
      <a href="/#waitlist" class="btn btn--quiet" data-track-cta="blog-join-waitlist">Join waitlist</a>
    </p>
  </div>
